Value HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_TYPE (.+?)
Value PART_NUMBER (.+?)
Value SERIAL_NUMBER (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_HW_MAC_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value BUILD_NUMBER (\S+)
Value ARCHITECTURE (\S+)
Value LAST_BOOTED (\S+)
Value TOTAL_MEMORY_KB (\d+)
Value FREE_MEMORY_KB (\d+)

Start
  ^Hostname\s*:\s*${HOSTNAME}\s*$$
  ^Chassis Type\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^Part Number\s*:\s*${PART_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^Serial Number\s*:\s*${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^System HW MAC Address\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_HW_MAC_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^Software Version\s*:\s*${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^Build Number\s*:\s*${BUILD_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^Architecture\s*:\s*${ARCHITECTURE}\s*$$
  ^Last Booted\s*:\s*${LAST_BOOTED}\s*$$
  ^Total Memory\s*:\s*${TOTAL_MEMORY_KB}\s+kB\s*$$
  ^Free Memory\s*:\s*${FREE_MEMORY_KB}\s+kB\s*$$ -> Record
